  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「やれやれ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「ちょっと張りきりすぎたっちね、あぁ疲れたっち」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 57,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「でもまぁ、どうにか無事に『水泳講座』は円満に終わったっちね♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 57,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「参加してくれたみんなも、満足してくれたみたいっち」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 57,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「おぉ、ここから帰る途中のみんなが見えるっち。みんな、いい笑顔してるっち～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「ばいば～い、気をつけて帰るっちよ。また泳ぎたくなったら、いつでもプールにおいでね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「かわいいなぁ、下級生って……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 57,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「おや？　転校生くん、あんたはまだ帰らないっちか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「ふぅん。みんなが更衣室を使ってる間は、気を遣って着替えられなかったっちか。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 57,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「んで帰りそびれたと、そりゃあご愁傷さまだっち」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 57,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「うちの学校、ずっと女子校みたいだったっちからね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「男の子のための、更衣室がないっちよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 57,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「あんた体育の授業のときとかどうしてるっち、トイレとかで着替えてるの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 57,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「まぁ、男子高校生にとっては夢のまた夢の、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「女子といっしょにプールの授業を受ける～っていうお楽しみがあるっちからね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 57,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「不満を言っちゃ、いけないっちよ。こんな女の子だらけの学校に転校してくる、あんたが悪いっち♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 57,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「よしよし。今日はたくさん手伝ってくれたし、おねいさんが労ってあげるっち」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「マッサージしてあげよっか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひびき",
    "text": "「水泳って意外と普段使ってない筋肉を使うっちからね、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 57,
